d a lot in my life from  people willing to extend me some benefit  of the doubt despite my own past  screw-ups yeah I think it's it's kind of  important to feel like you have the room  to change in that if you do people will  accept that so as much as this whole  situation was ridiculous I don't like  that it happened I don't like the  dragged out for as long as it did we  ultimately are going to get the  conclusion that I didn't dare to hope  for which which is we're going to get  the final installment of this story from  the guy who should be making it and who  I think has more than earned the right  to make it and yeah this was this was a  welcomed piece of good news on a day  that did not have a lot of good news and  this you know it sometimes it's hard for  me to make these videos you know knowing  other stuff that's going on in the world  outside of the stuff that I talk about  and I don't I oh god why am I doing this  I don't wanna I don't want to derail but  I feel there's a part of me that that  just feels the need to acknowledge that  like I dunno what else is going on I  know what happened in New Zealand and  this by no means suddenly makes this a  great day in history that this news  broke on the same day but it it was a  boost and it was nice to get and it's  silly and the grand scheme of things  it's stupid and superficial and in no  way can make up for other things that  are going on but it's a bit of good news  that I didn't think I'd ever see or have  and it made my day a little better and I  don't know if I've just brought  everybody's got this thing God what well  I think I'm just in a weird head space  today I don't know where like the whole  serious mood came in and white stayed or  what anyway James got his breakfast for  guardians of the galaxy holy crap oh I  gotta go to bed that's what I gotta do  what do you think about it whatever your  thoughts are drop something down in the  comments let's talk about a whole bunch  of stuff to do buttons